OL,3,AAndy Burnham refuses to back third
OL,4,Arunway at Heathrow
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has refused
OL,7,Fto say whether he backs a third runway
OL,8,Fat Heathrow after it emerged that the
OL,9,Fexpansion of the London airport could
OL,10,Fbe delayed by up to four years.
OL,12,FBurnham - who, as Mayor of Greater
OL,13,FManchester, opposed the project - told
OL,14,FSunday With Laura Kuenssberg: "I think
OL,15,Fprincipally, it's a matter for London
OL,16,Fand Londoners."
OL,18,FHe added: "I think we ought to hear the
OL,19,Fvoice of people there first. It's not
OL,20,Fright for me to just jump straight in
OL,21,Fon the back of the consultation."
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
